# ffmpeg/ffprobe static arm64 release builds (ffmpeg 8.1.2) from
# https://ffmpeg.martin-riedl.de (per-binary zips). One pin for both installs:
# macapp/build_app.sh bundles these binaries and setup.sh installs the same ones
# into vendor/ffmpeg for a source checkout.
